        "original_id": "f5141cb3-185e-54ae-8bfc-1861e899d057",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Franklin, Jimmy Hartridge, Brandon Boyd, Mike Einziger, Jose Pasillas, Alex \"Dirk Lance\" Katunich, Gavin \"DJ Lyfe\" Koppell, Ben Kenney, DJ Kilmore\n- Organizations: Swervedriver, Incubus\n- Places: Oxford, Calabasas High School\n- Products: Son of Mustang Ford\n- Topics: alternative rock, band formation, band lineup changes\n\nFacts:\n- Swervedriver is an English alternative rock band that was formed in Oxford in 1989 around core members Adam Franklin and Jimmy Hartridge.\n- Incubus was formed in 1991 by vocalist Brandon Boyd, lead guitarist Mike Einziger, and drummer Jose Pasillas while they were enrolled at Calabasas High School.\n- Incubus later expanded to include bassist Alex \"Dirk Lance\" Katunich and Gavin \"DJ Lyfe\" Koppell.\n- Alex \"Dirk Lance\" Katunich was eventually replaced in Incubus by bassist Ben Kenney.\n- Gavin \"DJ Lyfe\" Koppell was eventually replaced in Incubus by DJ Kilmore.\n- Son of Mustang Ford is the debut EP by the English alternative rock band Swervedriver.",
